# A noseslide on a real SoMa ledge: from the south rear runway at an angle, an ollie and I + up as it
# locks on the coping beside the runway (F04); about 40 ticks on, it runs into the F42 ledge's end and bails.
park soma
cmd 0 teleport 66.6 14.75 -0.3 30
cmd 2 speed 4.2
hold ollie 4..12
hold up 16..60
tap grind 18
bot balance
run 200
expect event grindStart{trick=BS Noseslide,slide=true} within 14..30
